{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"2048","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v3508","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"ゆうきあずさ","creatorId":"vndb:s8838","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2919","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8838","name":"ゆうきあずさ","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:9265","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"ゆうきあずさ","creatorId":"vndb:s8838","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2919","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8838","name":"ゆうきあずさ","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:9266","source":"egs"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"七瀬光","creatorId":"vndb:s761","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:3946","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s761","name":"七瀬光","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:16487","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"Peak A Soul+","creatorId":"vndb:s766","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s766","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s766","name":"Peak A Soul+","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:43562","source":"vndb"}],"other":[{"creditedName":"河井 英里","creatorId":"vndb:s883","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s883","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s883","name":"河井 英里","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:43563","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"ゆうき あずさ","creatorId":"vndb:s8838","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8838","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8838","name":"ゆうき あずさ","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:43566","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c20352","characterName":"アレクサンドル＝パストゥール","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c20352"},"originalCharacterName":"アレクサンドル＝パストゥール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Alex is the first prince of Hell (Naraku), the elder twin born from the right red eye of the King of Hell. He is to fight Platina to the death over the succession of Naraku. He doesn't really know Platina and has a lot of conflict over having to fight, especially as he is initially weaker than his brother. He is a bit selfish with a short temper if he doesn't get his way, but behind this lies a deep and caring attitude."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c20352"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bf435f7395ff5f23c802eee0edab11341aba4c67432ecc9ab29e22e2bce9c43b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/dfa323d7d6254034838b31ff54ea44002c03a3e63516f0f63f6a28317976deec.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高城 元気","creatorId":"vndb:s487","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s487","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s487","name":"高城 元気","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:23910","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c20353","characterName":"プラチナ＝パストゥール","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c20353"},"originalCharacterName":"プラチナ＝パストゥール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Platina is the second prince of Hell (Naraku), the younger twin born from the left blue eye of the King of Hell. He is to fight Alex to the death over the succession of Naraku. He is initially stronger than Alex and seems to have no problems fighting to save his own life, but inside he still struggles with internal conflict about the battle for succession. He is a bit calm and cold, taking a rather serious stance towards things, but he really is concerned with doing the right thing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c20353"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c02de34ee83ddc707caa2002c3d2398f97e37c1fb229beea15b6e386a3629937.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e5a387ec7ac1d303b3fea78fcfc1c0ef9e8ec663c9bbb3b83956232256ccd31f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鈴木 千尋","creatorId":"vndb:s182","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s182","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s182","name":"鈴木 千尋","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:23907","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c28904","characterName":"サフィルス＝ホーソン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c28904"},"originalCharacterName":"サフィルス＝ホーソン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sapphirus (called Sapphi by Alex) is Alex's staff officer. He has a rather cheery disposition, playing the role of teacher and care-taker of Alex, and holds amazing patience with Alex's stubborn attitude. Since he is trying to help Alex win the battle of succession, he takes on a rather rival-like relationship with Jade, Platina's staff officer. However, there is more to Sapphirus than meets the eye..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c28904"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/03/031748d852884a8d69d24699bd0a242e9d95ce53d3ac17603d168b71e8c03522.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/973c62f5d390ce36ab1fc1da051988cf3a277a9da5882f4767f7c76276d5a5da.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"関 智一","creatorId":"vndb:s249","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s249","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s249","name":"関智一","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:23908","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c28905","characterName":"ジェイド＝デイヴィス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c28905"},"originalCharacterName":"ジェイド＝デイヴィス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Jade is Platina's staff officer. He has a more serious and intelligent demeanor, with a quick tongue that may offend people, but he doesn't care. He is Platina's care-taker, and is very devoted to him. Since he is trying to help Platina win the battle of succession, he takes on a rather rival-like relationship with Sapphirus, Alex's staff officer. However, there seems to be a mysterious side of Jade that is hiding something..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c28905"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8c4317717281dbccc422a66906ee5b04f480bb99bb824372d6bea7cf9f04b039.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a0/a0417b2656d0ad726beccf4f7669169ff248f42df7066d550fca51b29f4344f2.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"森川 智之","creatorId":"vndb:s53","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s53","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s53","name":"森川智之","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:23903","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c28906","characterName":"ルビイ＝ジャンクソン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c28906"},"originalCharacterName":"ルビイ＝ジャンクソン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ruby is a care-free chivalrous thief who is now a lone hunter against the angels. He acts rather fun and playful, speaking in the quick Kansai dialect, but also has a serious side, especially when it comes to his quest for revenge against Carrol, his half-brother, who he hates since Carrol betrayed his trust in the past and gave him the scar across his chest. He is a good friend with a sense of humor, but he is also a strong fighter. He either becomes an ally to Alex or Platina, and whichever side he chooses, Carrol will be on the opposite side."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c28906"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d8/d8c39b100ccf5b33236d0f31050297b48129230c7d5d314ff64bfc7be74ce058.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/22/224d0d15f1ea85db04644ec60580e34338042b080bf35926ddbba643f5f25538.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"石川 英郎","creatorId":"vndb:s1533","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1533","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1533","name":"石川 英郎","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:23913","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c28907","characterName":"カロール＝マルテル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c28907"},"originalCharacterName":"カロール＝マルテル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Carrol is a half-angel priest who runs an orphanage for half-angel children. He is Ruby's half-brother, the son of an angel mother and Ruby's demon father. He holds a grudge against Ruby since Ruby's father left him and his mother, and Ruby got to experience a normal childhood that he never had being a half-angel, which eventually caused him to lash out against Ruby and give him the scar across his chest. He is very quiet and reserved, but has a short-temper hidden beneath. He either becomes an ally to Alex or Platina, and whichever side he chooses, Ruby will be on the opposite side."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c28907"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0f/0fe8168b51af5e314f27727557562c75ea60438f1a46e2ba73cf04cef507509a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/523dabb845eeff51fa417fdbf081ebef743d3f1faa44127fd3433426f754ba2d.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"保志 総一朗","creatorId":"vndb:s114","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s114","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s114","name":"保志 総一朗","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:23904","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c28908","characterName":"ロード＝クロサイト","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c28908"},"originalCharacterName":"ロード＝クロサイト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lhodo was once a male who was cursed into the body of a beautiful woman. She is a bounty hunter and con-artist with a very short-trigger temper: and when she gets angry she'll fight with a vengeance and strict determination. She can turn her outward personality from sugary-sweet one minute to wrathful the next, and isn't afraid to use her feminine body to fool people into thinking she is only a weak female when she is anything but. She has a major dislike of Plum, who placed the curse on her, and she will stop at nothing to hunt him down to break the curse. She either becomes an ally to Alex or Platina, and whichever side she chooses, Plum will be on the opposite side."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c28908"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2c6b15e3e4360b5846e9b7ade0ddf0c299c399dd0d9714b4d1a5593d7d2eea65.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/44d7769de8581783718011c5bdd8dde456e7ab99309ea3d921514c772a4362aa.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桑島 法子","creatorId":"vndb:s1186","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1186","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1186","name":"桑島 法子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:23911","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c28909","characterName":"プラム","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c28909"},"originalCharacterName":"プラム","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Plum is one of the last survivors of a rare race of animal people known as the Aprasas, who now are pretty much extinct except for the Aprasas guardians of the elemental shrines. Although not overly intelligent, he has a very sweet and innocent personality, tending to be kind to anyone. His family was killed by the bounty hunter Lhodo, so he cursed Lhodo into the body of a female, which was the first person Lhodo had killed, and is now being hunted by Lhodo. He either becomes an ally to Alex or Platina, and whichever side he chooses, Lhodo will be on the opposite side."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c28909"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/638708446ca30334d7797a9e4b424595b3ff571bc2bd24ad32f24cdee311c8a0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c1/c1adce37e9bf44f2bcf571888cdd0a9d288f60d70246820574d82a934632387a.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"南 央美","creatorId":"vndb:s1870","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1870","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1870","name":"南 央美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:23914","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c28910","characterName":"ベリル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c28910"},"originalCharacterName":"ベリル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Beryl has the appearance of a fourteen-year-old, but is actually an immortal magician who seems to appear, bringing either miracles or devastation, and then disappear again like the wind. He is well-known as the \"Blue Sage\" among the residents of Hell, but still remains an overall mystery... and part of that mystery seems to tie into a certain angel and the princes. He has a multi-faceted personality, which can seem playful at times, but also turns to very serious or mysterious, and he can be quite the smart-ass with his sharp tongue. He either becomes an ally to Alex or Platina, and whichever side he chooses, Zil will be on the opposite side."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c28910"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c2451512ff11bbb3f57cecd70d8e39c90b1200b6e427668c32659e86a2ccef20.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ef/efb2537f0da4ef5d4bbf8a3421c0994fac453f17210d27a68b8b1ded8f3b0818.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山口 勝平","creatorId":"vndb:s122","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s122","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s122","name":"山口 勝平","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:23905","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c28911","characterName":"ジル＝ヒイラギ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c28911"},"originalCharacterName":"ジル＝ヒイラギ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Zil is a former assassin who still keeps his appearance wrapped in clothing, his face often hidden behind a shroud of cloth. He is very silent, speaking only when he deems it necessary, and even then only says what he believes is the minimum amount of words needed to make his point. He lives very hermit-like in the mountains, where he does artwork. He is a very mysterious figure, who seems to have lived for a very long time and has a past with Beryl, who helped him gain revenge on the murderer of his wife. He either becomes an ally to Alex or Platina, and whichever side he chooses, Beryl will be on the opposite side."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c28911"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d8/d8fd0de4e74dd0ee365739209f978ece28fc40317ce88edf7bb27240427ed97d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f7/f7080c5a79449392e16a3da12632d26b97909c1243d770278fe03886a8736f02.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"菅原 正志","creatorId":"vndb:s2570","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2570","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2570","name":"菅原 正志","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:23915","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c28914","characterName":"椿色のメイア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c28914"},"originalCharacterName":"椿色のメイア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Aprasas who is the guardian of the element of Fire. You must fight her to gain her powers."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c28914"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9fd358502f89c6a98409973bcd5f35b6c9b607ac6570d0b82c990111df370023.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/12/12a818550a4b2f869805b93ab77f6e225365d46ecb9707da5af84a3c